    "notes": {
        "c27833cf-7032-4593-870c-f80706b24058": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 64,
            "width": 600,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Manual step required\n\nThe trigger reads a public channel as a user and cannot be provoked from inside the flow — nobody but the channel's admins can post there.\n\n1. Retarget: replace `@telegram` on **both** NewChannelPost and GetChannel (and the asserted URL) with a public channel you can post to.\n2. Start the flow. Flow start records the newest post as the baseline — older posts are never emitted.\n3. Publish a new post in that channel. The next poll emits it; AfterAll waits 600 s, otherwise the flow times out.\n\nAccount: a **Telegram User** account (`appmixer:telegram:user`)."
        }
    }
